<title>AUSTRIA: BBAG takes majority in Romanian brewery.</title>
<headline>BBAG takes majority in Romanian brewery.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian drinks group Oesterreichische Brau Beteiligungs AG (BBAG) said on Thursday it would acquire a majority stake in Romania's Arbema brewery through its Brau Union AG unit.</p>
<p>It gave no details of price or the size of its stake.</p>
</text>
